           _v_m          The vmem arena being destroyed.  The caller should en‐
                       sure that no one will use it anymore.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
     vvmmeemm__ccrreeaattee() returns a pointer to the newly allocated vmem_t.  Other‐
     wise, it returns NULL.

     On success, vvmmeemm__xxaalllloocc() and vvmmeemm__aalllloocc() return 0.  Otherwise, ENOMEM
     is returned.

