HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The vvmmeemm allocator was originally implemented in NetBSD.  It was intro‐
     duced in FreeBSD 10.0.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     Original implementation of vvmmeemm was written by YAMAMOTO Takashi.  The
     FreeBSD port was made by Jeff Roberson.

BBUUGGSS
     vvmmeemm relies on malloc(9), so it cannot be used as early during system
     bootstrap.

